    of your opponent''s turn. If this card is sent from your Monster Zone to your
    GY by an opponent''s card effect: You can Special Summon 1 Level 5 or higher
    "War Rock" monster from your hand or Deck. You can only use each effect of "War
    Rock Fortia" once per turn.'
